WEBVTT

00:07:27.850 --> 00:07:31.993
And that's why I'm here today.

00:07:31.993 --> 00:07:36.358
(Applause)

00:07:36.358 --> 00:07:39.849
Thank you.

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:46.583
Singing for me is sweet relief.

00:07:46.583 --> 00:07:55.430
It is the only time when I feel fluent.

00:07:55.430 --> 00:07:58.856
It is the only time when what comes out of my mouth

00:07:58.856 --> 00:08:01.448
is comprehensively exactly what I intended.